<div class="newsletter-page">
  <h1><%= _("Sign up to receive our news") %></h1>

  <p><%= _("We'll mail when we have news about WhatDoTheyKnow, stories about the inspiring ways people are using FOI, or action alerts when your right to information is under threat.") %></p>
  <p><%= _("You'll also receive messages about our wider work at <a href='https://www.mysociety.org/'>mySociety</a>, the charity that runs this site.") %></p>
  <p><%= _("We won't flood your inbox, and you can adjust your preferences or unsubscribe at any time.") %></p>

  <%= render 'general/newsletter_form' %>
</div>
